(STUDENT HOUSING LEASE AGREEMENT \(INDIVIDUAL LIABILITY\)) Tj T*
(MAGNOLIA ROW STUDENT APARTMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ARTICLE 1 PARTIES AND PREMISES) Tj T*
(1.1. Parties. This Student Housing Lease Agreement \("Lease"\) is made on July 20, 2026 between MR Gainesville Owner, LLC, by its managing agent,) Tj T*
(Hartwell Residential Management, LLC, 2600 SW Hartwell Lane, Gainesville, Florida 32608 \("Landlord" or "Management"\), and Sam Patel \("Resident"\).) Tj T*
(1.2. Premises. Landlord leases to Resident Bedroom D in Unit 1406, a four-bedroom, four-bathroom apartment at Magnolia Row Student Apartments, 2600 SW) Tj T*
(Hartwell Lane, Unit 1406, Gainesville, Florida 32608, together with the non-exclusive right to use the Unit's shared kitchen, living room, and laundry) Tj T*
(closet and the Community's common areas and amenities \(together, the "Premises"\).) Tj T*
(1.3. Roommates. Resident shares the Unit with up to three other residents, each of whom signs a separate lease with Landlord. Landlord may assign or) Tj T*
(reassign roommates to fill any vacant bedroom. Resident has no right to choose or approve a roommate assigned by Landlord.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ARTICLE 2 TERM) Tj T*
(2.1. Term. The term of this Lease begins on August 15, 2026 and ends at 12:00 noon on July 31, 2027.) Tj T*
(2.2. No Early Termination. Resident may not end this Lease before the end of the term except as provided in Article 12 or as required by law.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ARTICLE 3 RENT AND FEES) Tj T*
(3.1. Rent. Resident shall pay total rent of $9,468.00 for the term, payable in twelve \(12\) installments of $789.00 each. The first installment is due) Tj T*
(on or before August 15, 2026, and each later installment is due on the first day of each month from September 1, 2026 through July 1, 2027.) Tj T*
(Installments are not prorated. Rent is paid through the online resident portal.) Tj T*
(3.2. Late Charge. If any installment is not received by 11:59 p.m. on the fifth \(5th\) day of the month, Resident shall pay a late charge of $50.00,) Tj T*
(plus $10.00 for each later day, not to exceed $150.00 in any month.) Tj T*
(3.3. Fees. Resident shall pay a non-refundable application fee of $50.00, a non-refundable administrative fee of $200.00, and a non-refundable amenity) Tj T*
(fee of $150.00, each due at signing. The amenity fee is for access to the Community amenities and is not refundable for any reason, including the) Tj T*
(closure of any amenity.) Tj T*
(3.4. Individual Liability. Resident is responsible only for the Rent and charges under this Lease and is not responsible for the rent of any roommate.) Tj T*
(However, Resident and all residents of the Unit are jointly and severally liable for damage to the Unit's shared areas \(kitchen, living room, laundry) Tj T*
(closet, and hallways\) and its shared appliances when Landlord cannot determine which resident caused the damage, and such charges will be divided) Tj T*
(equally among the residents of the Unit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Magnolia Row Student Housing Lease | Page 1 of 3) Tj
